WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.740
San Lucas, Kapitulo 8

00:30.000 --> 00:47.380
Magdalena, anakapaksiyatan kadigiti Pito Adimonio, ni Juana, nga asawa ni Cusa, a katalik ni Herodes, ni Susana, ken adupay a babae, anang ipaay kadigiti San Ikwada, a kastulong ken ni Jesus, ken kadigiti Adalana.

00:49.240 --> 00:54.640
Saan nga agsardeng tipanagsangpet dagditi tattao amapan ken ni Jesus?

00:55.760 --> 00:58.460
Naggapuda kadigiti na dumaduma nga ili.

00:58.460 --> 01:04.200
Idi na ornongan ti adu atao, sinaritan na daytoy apang ngarig.

01:28.460 --> 01:33.720
Nalailay da, tasaan anadamag ti daga anagdiswan da.

01:34.480 --> 01:43.300
Nagdiso ti sumagmamano a bukel itinagtubuan dagditi si Itan Amula, anakigidan adimakkel, ken nanglipas kadakwada.

01:44.960 --> 01:48.660
Adamit kadagiti bukel anagdiso itinadamag adaga.

01:49.700 --> 01:53.880
Nagtubo, ken nagbunga da itisagsasangagasot.

01:54.620 --> 01:58.420
Dumnag ngarod ti siya sinuman nga adaan.

01:58.460 --> 02:01.340
Ang gibos ni Jesus.

02:01.840 --> 02:06.140
Sinulod so, dagditi Adalana ni Jesus, di kaipapananday toy apang ngarig.

02:06.800 --> 02:10.680
Naipakaam mo kada kayo, dagditi palimid, tipagarian ti Diyos.

02:11.460 --> 02:12.580
Insumbat ni Jesus.

02:13.500 --> 02:16.520
Ngam, maipakaam mo dagditi, kadagditi daduma.

02:17.260 --> 02:19.320
Babaen, kadagditi pang ngarig.

02:19.980 --> 02:23.860
Tap no uray kit kitaan da, di da mailasin.

02:23.860 --> 02:27.860
Ken uray dingding ganda, di da maawat.

02:28.460 --> 02:31.680
Inaipakan mo kayo, da ito'y di kaipapananday pang ngarig.

02:33.460 --> 02:35.540
Ti bukel, iso ti saot ti Diyos.

02:36.700 --> 02:39.080
Dagditi nagdiso itiigit ti dalan.

02:40.380 --> 02:42.960
Iladawan da, dagditi tattao adumngag.

02:44.540 --> 02:48.640
Ngam, umay ti jablo, kit ikaten natin mensahe iti puso da.

02:49.580 --> 02:52.080
Tap no dida mamati, ken maisalakan.

02:53.460 --> 02:55.540
Dagditi nagdiso iti kabatuan.

02:55.540 --> 03:00.660
Iladawan da dagit itat-tao adumngag iti mensahe,

03:01.220 --> 03:03.340
Ken awaten da asira ragsak.

03:04.840 --> 03:07.760
Ngayom saan nga umunag iti mensahe kadakwada?

03:09.100 --> 03:10.940
Mamati da iti apagbiit.

03:12.140 --> 03:13.260
Ngayom sumina da,

03:13.740 --> 03:16.560
Nudumteng iti tsyempo apan nakasuot.

03:17.260 --> 03:20.260
Dagitinagdiso iti ayan dagitisi itan amula.

03:21.380 --> 03:24.040
Kayarigan da dagit itat-tao adumngag.

03:24.040 --> 03:27.140
Ngayom dagit ipakaring guran,

03:27.500 --> 03:28.520
Ken kinabaknang,

03:29.100 --> 03:30.880
Ken ragragsak dito'y abyag,

03:32.060 --> 03:33.120
Lepwesen da ida,

03:33.980 --> 03:36.560
Ket saan amatang kanan dagitibunga da.

03:38.040 --> 03:40.340
Dagitinagdiso itinadamag adaga,

03:41.640 --> 03:45.140
Iladawan da dagit itat-tao adumngag iti mensahe,

03:46.520 --> 03:48.500
Salimut matanda itinaimbag,

03:48.500 --> 03:50.440
Ken natulnog apuso,

03:51.560 --> 03:53.060
Ket ag talinaid da,

03:53.060 --> 03:55.300
Aging ga itiagbunga da.

03:56.020 --> 03:58.060
Awan mang gangat itipagsilawan,

03:59.500 --> 04:00.460
Sana kaluban,

04:01.100 --> 04:03.500
Wen no ikabil itisirok tipagidaan,

04:04.320 --> 04:07.200
Ikabil na kit di itinairanta apagyanan na,

04:07.740 --> 04:11.060
Tap no makita dagit itat-tao tilawag na nusumregda.

04:12.080 --> 04:15.160
Taawan tinailimang adinto mailatak,

04:16.600 --> 04:18.000
Ket awan tipalimad,

04:18.460 --> 04:19.500
Adinto maamuan,

04:19.780 --> 04:20.980
Ken maiparangarang.

04:22.360 --> 04:23.040
Agan na,

04:23.040 --> 04:25.460
Nand kayo ngarod itipanagdangdangnagyo,

04:26.900 --> 04:27.820
Tati at daan,

04:28.940 --> 04:30.780
Maikantupay itiad-aduh,

04:32.180 --> 04:33.220
Ket tiawanan,

04:34.440 --> 04:36.900
Uray pay tipagarot na nga adakin kuwana,

04:37.560 --> 04:38.580
Maikantupay.

04:39.320 --> 04:41.300
Napan ken ni Jesus ni inana,

04:41.440 --> 04:43.460
Kendagitin lalaki at kakabsat na,

04:44.220 --> 04:46.140
Ngayong dida makaasidag ken kuwana,

04:46.240 --> 04:47.860
Gapu itikaaduh iti tao.

04:48.640 --> 04:49.940
Adai jayroar ni inam,

04:50.080 --> 04:51.840
Kendagitin lalaki at kakabsat mo,

04:51.840 --> 04:52.880
Ket kaya't,

04:52.880 --> 04:53.600
Nagkakamakita.

04:54.400 --> 04:55.320
Adanag ko na,

04:55.500 --> 04:55.980
Ken ni Jesus.

04:56.940 --> 04:57.460
Ti ina,

04:57.660 --> 04:59.160
Ken kakabsat ko.

04:59.980 --> 05:01.380
Isuda dagitidong nga,

05:01.620 --> 05:02.640
Ken mang tungpal,

05:02.940 --> 05:03.940
Iti sa oti Diyos.

05:05.940 --> 05:07.980
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada amin.

05:09.100 --> 05:10.300
Iti may sangal daw,

05:11.260 --> 05:12.340
Limuga ni Jesus,

05:12.480 --> 05:13.660
Ken dagitin adalan na,

05:13.780 --> 05:14.420
Itibangka,

05:14.600 --> 05:15.920
Ket kinunanang kadakwada.

05:16.680 --> 05:17.700
Bumalas yu tayo.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.300
Nagrubwat da,

05:19.520 --> 05:20.860
Ket idi aglaylayag da,

05:21.820 --> 05:22.740
Nakaturog ni Jesus.

05:23.720 --> 05:26.560
Dimten tinapigsang ang angin iti danaaw,

05:27.160 --> 05:28.440
Ket mang rugin ang mapno,

05:28.580 --> 05:29.640
Itibangka itinanong.

05:30.400 --> 05:31.020
Itikasta,

05:31.640 --> 05:32.380
Napaggag,

05:32.680 --> 05:33.580
Itikasasaad ka.

05:34.500 --> 05:35.800
Napandag iti adalan,

05:35.920 --> 05:36.520
Ken Jesus,

05:36.760 --> 05:37.660
Ket riniin.

05:38.460 --> 05:39.060
Apo!

05:39.580 --> 05:40.300
Apo!

05:41.100 --> 05:41.780
Kinunan da,

05:42.540 --> 05:43.780
Lumnet tayon!

05:44.660 --> 05:45.760
Imango ni Jesus,

05:45.880 --> 05:47.320
Ket binilin na ti angin,

05:47.560 --> 05:49.100
Ken dagitin adawal at dalul.

05:50.140 --> 05:50.820
Nagtalnada,

05:51.000 --> 05:52.080
Ket malinakmanan,

05:52.320 --> 05:52.860
Iti danaaw,

05:53.680 --> 05:54.440
Kinunan ni Jesus,

05:54.560 --> 05:55.440
Ket gitin adalan,

05:56.280 --> 05:57.220
Sa dino ti yan,

05:57.320 --> 05:58.120
Ti pamatiw.

05:58.860 --> 05:59.500
Ngamga po,

05:59.580 --> 06:00.380
Iti sidaaw,

06:00.500 --> 06:01.080
Ken amakda.

06:01.820 --> 06:02.400
Kinunan da,

06:02.460 --> 06:03.100
Iti maisa,

06:03.160 --> 06:03.760
Ken maisa.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.420
Anya ti katataon na rito'y,

06:06.940 --> 06:08.200
Bilinin na ti angin,

06:08.340 --> 06:09.460
Ket dagitin daluyon,

06:09.600 --> 06:10.660
Ket agtolnog da,

06:10.720 --> 06:11.320
Ken kuwana.

06:12.140 --> 06:12.900
Intuloy da,

06:13.020 --> 06:13.820
Tinaglayag,

06:13.900 --> 06:14.720
Ket damdang da,

06:14.720 --> 06:15.860
Iti daga dagitin,

06:15.940 --> 06:16.620
Gergeseno.

06:17.320 --> 06:17.720
Iti balasew,

06:18.760 --> 06:19.520
Ti danaaw,

06:19.640 --> 06:20.220
Ti galilee.

06:20.800 --> 06:22.420
Idi sumanglad ni Jesus,

06:22.880 --> 06:23.680
Sinaba,

06:23.820 --> 06:24.920
Ti maisa alalaki,

06:25.080 --> 06:25.820
At taga ili,

06:25.940 --> 06:26.700
Anabayagan,

06:26.840 --> 06:27.520
Alinuganan,

06:27.660 --> 06:28.300
Nagititimun.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.240
Lamo-lamo,

06:30.660 --> 06:31.740
Ketsaan nga agtaon,

06:31.860 --> 06:32.460
Itibalayin,

06:32.460 --> 06:33.940
Nudikat katakititan tanam.

06:34.860 --> 06:35.420
Apaman,

06:35.520 --> 06:36.720
Anakitan na ni Jesus,

06:37.280 --> 06:38.000
Nagikis,

06:38.160 --> 06:39.140
Sa nagparintumong,

06:39.340 --> 06:40.120
Itisangwanan na.

06:41.180 --> 06:41.860
Jesus,

06:41.960 --> 06:43.460
Nanak ti Diyos,

06:43.640 --> 06:44.800
Akangatwan.

06:46.620 --> 06:47.520
Impokaw na.

06:48.280 --> 06:48.820
Kanya,

06:49.260 --> 06:50.380
Tikayat mo,

06:50.620 --> 06:51.220
Kanya,

06:51.220 --> 06:54.220
Ang aasim,

06:54.320 --> 06:57.320
Tadina parigaten.

06:59.120 --> 07:00.320
Kasta ti sinauna,

07:00.420 --> 07:01.420
Taimpili ni Jesus,

07:01.520 --> 07:03.020
Iti dakas ni espiritu,

07:03.120 --> 07:05.120
Arumwar iti dayta alalaki.

07:05.820 --> 07:06.520
Masansan,

07:06.620 --> 07:07.520
Aparigatan na,

07:07.620 --> 07:08.620
Kat uray tanglan,

07:08.720 --> 07:10.420
Kan kawaran dadag iti ima,

07:10.520 --> 07:11.520
Kan sakala.

07:12.020 --> 07:12.920
Pugsutan na,

07:13.020 --> 07:13.620
Ti kawar,

07:13.720 --> 07:14.420
Sa iturong,

07:14.520 --> 07:15.420
Ti demonyo,

07:15.520 --> 07:16.420
Itiletang.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.520
An niya tinagan mo?

07:18.620 --> 07:20.620
Sinaludsod ni Jesus,

07:21.220 --> 07:24.120
Armada.

07:25.120 --> 07:27.120
Insumbat ti tao,

07:27.220 --> 07:28.520
Taado a demonyo,

07:28.620 --> 07:30.120
Ti limugan ken kuwana.

07:30.220 --> 07:32.120
Dinawat na kiti demonyo,

07:32.220 --> 07:33.120
Ken ni Jesus,

07:33.220 --> 07:34.120
Adina ibaon ida,

07:34.220 --> 07:35.120
Iti yuyang.

07:35.220 --> 07:37.120
Iti asidig sa djay,

07:37.220 --> 07:39.120
Adadakal nga arbaan,

07:39.220 --> 07:40.120
Ti baboy,

07:40.220 --> 07:41.120
Amangmangan,

07:41.220 --> 07:42.120
Iti bakras,

07:42.220 --> 07:43.120
Iti turot.

07:43.220 --> 07:45.120
Nagpakpakaasid na kiti demonyo,

07:45.220 --> 07:46.120
Ken Jesus,

07:46.220 --> 07:47.120
Apalubusan na ida,

07:47.220 --> 07:49.120
Asumrut ka na kiti baboy,

07:49.220 --> 07:51.120
Pinalubusan na ida.

07:51.220 --> 07:52.020
Rimuwar na ro,

07:52.120 --> 07:52.920
Dagiti demonyo,

07:53.020 --> 07:53.720
Iti tao,

07:53.820 --> 07:54.620
Kat sumbrekda,

07:54.720 --> 07:55.620
Kadagiti baboy.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.320
Nagdadarison,

07:57.420 --> 07:58.620
Ti enterong arbaan,

07:58.720 --> 07:59.520
Iti tepang,

07:59.620 --> 08:00.220
Sada,

08:00.320 --> 08:01.020
Iti mapwak,

08:01.120 --> 08:01.820
Iti danaw,

08:01.920 --> 08:03.220
Kat nalmasda amin.

08:03.320 --> 08:05.220
Idimakita,

08:05.320 --> 08:05.820
Dagiti,

08:05.920 --> 08:06.720
Agtartarakan,

08:06.820 --> 08:07.720
Kadagiti baboy,

08:07.820 --> 08:08.620
Tinapasamak.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.620
Nagtatarayda,

08:10.720 --> 08:11.320
Anapan,

08:11.420 --> 08:12.320
Nagipadamag,

08:12.420 --> 08:13.020
Itiili,

08:13.120 --> 08:14.220
Kan kadagiti barbaryo.

08:14.320 --> 08:16.320
Napan kinita,

08:16.420 --> 08:17.420
Dagiti tatao,

08:17.520 --> 08:18.420
Tinapasamak.

08:18.520 --> 08:20.520
Idimakadanon da,

08:20.520 --> 08:22.720
Iti ayan ni Yesus,

08:22.820 --> 08:23.720
Nasarakanda,

08:23.820 --> 08:24.820
Ti lalaki,

08:24.920 --> 08:25.820
Anakapaksyatan,

08:25.920 --> 08:27.820
Dagiti demonyo.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.720
Agtugtugaw,

08:28.820 --> 08:29.720
Anakabadon,

08:29.820 --> 08:30.620
Iti sakaanan,

08:30.720 --> 08:32.320
Ni Yesus.

08:32.420 --> 08:33.320
Nagpulangan,

08:33.420 --> 08:34.320
Tinasayaat,

08:34.420 --> 08:35.920
Apanunot na,

08:36.020 --> 08:36.620
Nagbutang,

08:36.720 --> 08:37.520
Dagiti amin,

08:37.620 --> 08:38.920
At at tao.

08:39.020 --> 08:39.620
Sinarita,

08:39.720 --> 08:40.920
Dagiti nakaimatang,

08:41.020 --> 08:41.920
Itinapasamak,

08:42.020 --> 08:42.620
Nukasanot,

08:42.720 --> 08:43.620
Ipanakaimbag,

08:43.720 --> 08:45.220
Ti lalaki.

08:45.320 --> 08:45.620
Gapu,

08:45.720 --> 08:46.420
Itikastaunay,

08:46.520 --> 08:46.920
Abutang,

08:47.020 --> 08:49.020
Dagiti gargiseno,

08:49.120 --> 08:49.720
Dinawatda,

08:49.820 --> 08:50.420
Kin Yesus,

08:50.520 --> 08:52.520
Na pumanaw sadyay.

08:52.620 --> 08:54.820
Limugan nga rood ni Yesus itibangka,

08:54.920 --> 08:56.720
Kat pimanaw.

08:56.820 --> 08:57.920
Nagpakpakaasik,

08:58.020 --> 08:58.620
Kin Yesus,

08:58.720 --> 08:59.520
Ti lalaki,

08:59.620 --> 09:00.520
Anakapaksyatan,

09:00.620 --> 09:01.520
Dagiti demonyo,

09:01.620 --> 09:02.620
Amakikuyog kuma,

09:02.720 --> 09:04.020
Kin kuwana.

09:04.120 --> 09:05.920
Ngong pinagawid ni Yesus,

09:06.020 --> 09:07.320
Akunana.

09:07.420 --> 09:09.020
Agawid kakit di,

09:09.120 --> 09:10.620
Kat saritaan ti amin,

09:10.720 --> 09:11.320
Nga inaramid,

09:11.420 --> 09:11.820
Ti Diyos,

09:11.920 --> 09:12.920
Kin ka.

09:13.020 --> 09:13.620
Nagawid,

09:13.720 --> 09:14.520
Ti lalaki,

09:14.620 --> 09:15.620
Kan impadamag na,

09:15.720 --> 09:17.120
Iti entero nga ili,

09:17.220 --> 09:17.920
Ti inaramid,

09:18.020 --> 09:18.620
Ni Yesus,

09:18.720 --> 09:19.920
Kin kuwana.

09:19.920 --> 09:21.420
Idi agsubli ni Yesus,

09:21.520 --> 09:22.520
Iti ballasyo,

09:22.620 --> 09:24.420
Ti danaaw.

09:24.520 --> 09:25.220
Inawat,

09:25.320 --> 09:26.020
Asiraragsak,

09:26.120 --> 09:28.020
Dakiti ado at at tao,

09:28.120 --> 09:29.220
Anang paspasungad,

09:29.320 --> 09:30.920
Kin kuwana.

09:31.020 --> 09:31.920
Kat demteng,

09:32.020 --> 09:33.020
Ti may sa ataong,

09:33.120 --> 09:33.820
Agnagan,

09:33.920 --> 09:35.320
Hayro.

09:35.420 --> 09:36.620
May sa apangulo,

09:36.720 --> 09:37.520
Iti sinagoga,

09:37.620 --> 09:39.220
Sadyay.

09:39.320 --> 09:40.020
Nagrukbab,

09:40.120 --> 09:41.520
Iti sangwana ni Yesus,

09:41.620 --> 09:43.320
Kat nagpakpakaasik,

09:43.420 --> 09:44.020
Kin kuwana,

09:44.120 --> 09:44.620
Amapan,

09:44.720 --> 09:46.320
Iti balay na.

09:46.420 --> 09:47.220
Dandaning amin,

09:47.320 --> 09:47.820
Matay,

09:47.920 --> 09:48.620
Ti kakaisuna,

09:48.720 --> 09:49.220
Nga anak na,

09:49.320 --> 09:49.820
Ababae,

09:49.920 --> 09:50.820
Nga agtawan,

09:50.920 --> 09:51.620
Iti sangapulo,

09:51.720 --> 09:53.220
Kat dua.

09:53.320 --> 09:55.620
Idi magmagnan ni Yesus,

09:55.720 --> 09:56.720
Inaribong bungan,

09:56.820 --> 09:58.520
Dakiti tat tao,

09:58.620 --> 09:59.320
At dasadyay,

09:59.420 --> 10:00.820
Ti may sa ababae,

10:00.920 --> 10:01.820
Nga gsagsagaba,

10:01.920 --> 10:03.020
Iti panagbulos,

10:03.120 --> 10:04.720
Ti dara.

10:04.820 --> 10:05.520
Sangapulo,

10:05.620 --> 10:06.820
Kat dua at awinan,

10:06.920 --> 10:07.820
Nga gsagsagaba,

10:07.920 --> 10:08.820
Kat nagastuna,

10:08.920 --> 10:09.820
Aminan,

10:09.920 --> 10:10.620
Asan ni kuwana,

10:10.720 --> 10:12.020
Kadakiti manggagas,

10:12.120 --> 10:13.520
Ngamawan na kapaimbag,

10:13.620 --> 10:15.020
Kin kuwana.

10:15.120 --> 10:16.120
Nakilin netlet,

10:16.220 --> 10:17.620
Kadakiti tat tao,

10:17.720 --> 10:18.320
Kat napan,

10:18.420 --> 10:19.220
Iti likudan,

10:19.220 --> 10:21.120
Ni Yesus.

10:21.220 --> 10:22.020
Sinagid na,

10:22.120 --> 10:22.720
Ti gayadan,

10:22.820 --> 10:23.420
Ti kagay,

10:23.520 --> 10:24.820
Ni Yesus.

10:24.920 --> 10:25.720
Kat dagos,

10:25.820 --> 10:26.620
Anagsardang,

10:26.720 --> 10:27.620
Ti panagbulos,

10:27.720 --> 10:28.920
Ti dara na.

10:29.020 --> 10:31.320
Siya sino tinangsagid kaniyak?

10:31.420 --> 10:33.620
Sinaludsod ni Yesus.

10:33.720 --> 10:35.420
Saan asyak?

10:35.520 --> 10:37.520
Maysa maysa tinagkuna.

10:37.620 --> 10:39.020
Apo.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.720
Kinunan ni Pedro.

10:40.820 --> 10:42.020
Ado at at tao,

10:42.120 --> 10:43.120
Ti agdidin noron,

10:43.220 --> 10:44.920
Itilawlaw mo.

10:45.020 --> 10:47.020
Adnan ang sagid kaniyak.

10:47.120 --> 10:49.120
Impapati ni Yesus,

10:49.220 --> 10:50.220
Tanariknak nga

10:50.320 --> 10:51.220
Adapan na kabalin

10:51.320 --> 10:52.920
Anauyos kaniyak.

10:53.020 --> 10:54.420
Idi makita ti babae

10:54.520 --> 10:56.220
Anadoktalan nun,

10:56.320 --> 10:57.820
Agtigtigirger anapan

10:57.920 --> 10:59.220
Kin Yesus sa nagrukbab

10:59.320 --> 11:01.020
Itisangwanan na.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.620
Itiimatang nagiti amin

11:02.720 --> 11:04.320
At at tao.

11:04.420 --> 11:05.920
Impalawag na no apay

11:06.020 --> 11:07.820
Asinagid na ni Yesus

11:07.920 --> 11:09.420
Kin tipan nakaimbag na

11:09.520 --> 11:10.820
Adagos.

11:10.920 --> 11:12.120
Anak ko,

11:12.220 --> 11:13.120
Pinaimbag na ka

11:13.220 --> 11:14.720
Tipang matim.

11:14.820 --> 11:16.520
Kinunan ni Yesus.

11:16.620 --> 11:17.720
Agawid kan

11:17.820 --> 11:19.020
Asi tatal na.

11:19.220 --> 11:19.720
Madama,

11:19.820 --> 11:20.920
Paila ang asasawang

11:21.020 --> 11:22.220
Daytoy ni Yesus,

11:22.320 --> 11:23.720
Ididumtang tinaibaon

11:23.820 --> 11:26.420
Anagapo itibalay ni Jairo.

11:26.520 --> 11:28.620
Natayin ti anak mo.

11:28.720 --> 11:30.620
Kinunanak ka ni Jairo.

11:30.720 --> 11:31.920
Saan muna aring guren

11:32.020 --> 11:33.520
Ti maestro?

11:33.620 --> 11:35.220
Ngamangagdaytoy ni Yesus

11:35.320 --> 11:37.320
Kat kinunanak ka ni Jairo.

11:37.420 --> 11:39.220
Di ka agdanag.

11:39.320 --> 11:41.720
Papigsam kit diti pang matin.

11:41.820 --> 11:43.020
Kat umimbag to

11:43.120 --> 11:44.420
Ti anak mo.

11:44.520 --> 11:47.120
Ididumtang ni Yesus itibalay.

11:47.220 --> 11:48.320
Awan pinastretna

11:48.320 --> 11:50.520
Ano dilaan da Pedro?

11:50.620 --> 11:51.720
Wan,

11:51.820 --> 11:53.620
Sanchago kandagitin na ganak

11:53.720 --> 11:55.020
Itiubing.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.320
Amin nga ada sa Jai

11:56.420 --> 11:57.320
Sangsangitan

11:57.420 --> 11:58.720
Kendungdung awan da

11:58.820 --> 12:00.020
Itiubing.

12:00.120 --> 12:02.220
Di kay agsangsangit.

12:02.320 --> 12:04.120
Kinunan ni Yesus.

12:04.220 --> 12:06.520
Saan anatay itiubing?

12:06.620 --> 12:08.520
Mat maturog laeng.

12:08.620 --> 12:10.620
Linalais da ni Yesus.

12:10.720 --> 12:13.220
Taamuda anatayon itiubing.

12:13.320 --> 12:14.720
Ngom inigkaman ni Yesus

12:14.820 --> 12:16.520
Ti ima itiubing.

12:16.520 --> 12:19.020
Anak, bumangon ka.

12:19.120 --> 12:21.020
Kinunan ni Yesus.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.620
Nagungar itiubing.

12:22.720 --> 12:25.020
Katimak der adagos.

12:25.120 --> 12:28.420
Imbilin ni Yesus na ikanda iti kanan na.

12:28.520 --> 12:30.520
Nasdaaw dagitin na ganak.

12:30.620 --> 12:33.720
Ngayom imbilin ni Yesus kadakwada nga awan.

12:33.820 --> 12:36.420
Pag ibagbaga anda itinapasamak.

